lounge where the coffee ritual\nbecomes audiovisual sessions of energy, focus and motivation \u2014 rhythmic\nmusic, a guiding voice, golden steam, and a holographic brain that lights up\nwith your progress.\n\u2615 DOUBLE ESPRESSO \u2014 YOUR ENERGY PROGRAM\nTen professionally mixed audio tracks in English and Spanish: five deep\nsessions (Morning Ritual, The Grind, Extraction, Aroma & Memory, Energy &\nFocus) plus five 5-minute quick shots for when you need a boost right now.\nMusic, positive affirmations and rhythmic pulses, mixed for the headset.\n\ud83e\udde0 A BRAIN THAT PULSES WITH YOU\nOur holographic visualizer \u2014 an artistic representation, not a medical one \u2014\ngoes from dormant bronze to radiant gold as your session builds, beating in\nsync with the music.\n\u26a1 POWERS STAGE\nSome sessions wake up the caf\u00e9's electric side: surprise visual effects at\nthe center of the stage, different every time.\n\ud83d\udc9b COFFEE DATE WITH VALENTINA\nFive minutes of virtual company: Valentina walks in, sits at your table and\nchats with you \u2014 hundreds of voiced lines with subtitles, facial\nexpressions, blinking and natural gaze. A warm way to end the day.\n\ud83c\udfc6 YOUR 4-WEEK PLAN\nA consistency calendar, streaks, accumulated minutes and the Brain Caf\u00e9\nCommunity. Everything is stored locally on your headset.\nFeatures\n100% comfortable: fully enjoyable seated,", "short_description": "Your futuristic brain caf\u00e9: energy & focus sessions, golden beats, a\nholographic brain \u2014 and a coffee date with Valentina."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1206224115025209", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Brain Coffee", "keywords": ["cafe", "relajacion"], "long_description": "Entra a la cafeter\u00eda m\u00e1s exclusiva del universo: la tuya.\nVirtual Brain Coffee VR es una experiencia premium de bienestar y\nentretenimiento para Meta Quest. Un lounge futurista e